discussion_comments.comment_body:
Rather than using `resourceId()` + `dependsOn`, I would recommend instead doing:

```bicep
resource subnet 'Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks/subnets@2023-05-01' existing = {
  parent: vnet
  name: subnetName
}
```

And then referencing this resource with:
```bicep
subnet: {
  id: subnet.id
}
```

Same comment here:
```bicep
resource inboundNatRule 'Microsoft.Network/loadBalancers/inboundNatRules@2023-05-01' existing = {
  parent: lb
  name: 'RDP-VM0'
}
```

Reference it as:
```bicep
loadBalancerInboundNatRules: [{
  id: inboundNatRule.id
}]
```

